<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Propane cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Propane cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has reduced its rating for Suburban Propane Partners LP to neutral from outperform, a source at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Whippany, N.J., propane retailer closed on Tuesday at 20-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
